{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:38:50.437Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ed091af054d2c4ac942bd73be99b68779d26ded57672315e2d70461d316b63d1","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's digests show. Only the Vantorre Group date is stated outright. The other owners come from how the digests describe each account.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato owns it. It changed hands on **2026-05-04**, from Nadia Fennimore. The 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\". The 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day. The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he took it over that day. Earlier digests already call it \"Gideon's fleet account\", so I can't tell whether he held it before 5/4.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, most likely. The Sep 2025 and Sep 30, 2026 digests refer to \"Gideon's medical account\". The latest digest names Orlavine as 55 seats, but it never ties the name to Gideon directly. A March 2025 digest called it \"Nadia's medical account\", so it has changed hands at some point.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I can't confirm an owner. The digests only say \"the Strategic pod's outdoor/retail account\". Nadia is the only person shown working on it, in the 9/30 training session. That isn't an ownership statement. Please check the CRM before it goes on the slide."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
